    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσειλ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτιειλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>press</i> or <i>force
			towards</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰεί μιν ἐπὶ νῆας . . προτιειλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.347
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆ: μὴ προσείλει χεῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					445
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be confined, cooped up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κατὰ μέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
